ivating an Ability inflicts 50 damage upon you."},"Gearless":{"value":"Gear Embargo","desc":"Gear cannot be used."},"GestatingTumors":{"value":"Sporogenesis","desc":"Techrot Tumors appear near Hell-Scrubbers, increasing the rate of life support decay with each active tumor."},"GrowingIncursion":{"value":"Fissure Cascade","desc":"Fissures rip into the mission, causing the Enemy Level to go up by 1 every 10s. Destroy them to stop the level from increasing further."},"HarshWords":{"value":"Barbed Glyphs","desc":"Each Glyph inflicts a small amount of damage when collected."},"HeavyWarfare":{"value":"Heavy Warfare","desc":"Enemies take 95% less damage from non-heavy weapons. Enemies will drop heavy ammo packs and heavy weapon recall time reduced to 5s."},"HighScalingLegacyte":{"value":"Growth Hormones","desc":"Legacytes are more powerful with each generation but take longer to escape."},"HostileOvergrowth":{"value":"It's Alive","desc":"Within the underground, hostile overgrowths will attack if players stops moving."},"HostileSecurity":{"value":"Eroding Senses","desc":"The Auricle and Vitreum take damage over time, collecting the required Vosphene Glyphs will halt the degradation and partially heal them."},"InfectedTechrot":{"value":"Corrupted Flesh","desc":"Techrot enemies are infused with Efervon and take damage over time. They explode when killed and leave behind deadly Efervon in their wake."},"InfiniteTide":{"value":"Relentless Tide","desc":"The Fragmented Tide never stops attacking."},"JadeSpring":{"value":"Jade Spirits","desc":"Jade Wisps haunt the region. If approached, they chase down the player responsible and transform into Jade Light beams."},"KahlSyndicate":{"value":"Kahl's Garrison"},"Knifestep":{"value":"Knifestep Syndrome","desc":"Lose 2 Health when moving. Jumping pauses the effect."},"LostInTranslation":{"value":"Glyph Inflation","desc":"The security system requires twice as many Vosphene Glyphs to activate."},"MiasmiteHive":{"value":"Miasmite Swarm","de