rops and gear is reduced 75%."},"SteelMeridianSyndicate":{"value":"Steel Meridian"},"StickyFingers":{"value":"Engorged Gruzzlings","desc":"All gruzzlings are Eximus."},"TankReinforcements":{"value":"Reinforcements","desc":"Reinforcements will arrive during the fight."},"TankStrongArmor":{"value":"Thermian Plating","desc":"Only Thermian RPGs can damage the tank. Reinforcements that carry Thermian RPGs will arrive during the fight"},"TankSuperToxic":{"value":"Toxic Tank","desc":"The tank has a Toxin aura, leaves Toxin trails, and its attacks all deal Toxin damage."},"TechrotConjunction":{"value":"Pile-On","desc":"Techrot enemies attempt to melee attack Hell-Scrubbers, bursting on contact and increasing scrubber contamination by 25%."},"TimeDilation":{"value":"Abbreviated Abilities","desc":"Ability durations reduced by 50%."},"Undersupplied":{"value":"Undersupplied","desc":"Max ammo on all weapons reduced by 75%"},"UnpoweredCapsules":{"value":"Parasitic Towers","desc":"Life Support Towers only activate after 20 enemies have been killed within a 15m radius of them."},"VentKidsSyndicate":{"value":"Schacht-Kinder"},"VoidAberration":{"value":"Vampyric Liminus","desc":"Slow moving, immortal, Duviri Liminus drain health and energy from allies who get too close."},"VoidEnergyOverload":{"value":"Ability Overload","desc":"Using an Ability opens a Void Rift on top of you."},"Voidburst":{"value":"Postmortal Surges","desc":"Slain enemies burts with Void energy."},"VolatileGrenades":{"value":"Hazardous Goods","desc":"Amphors deal elemental damage while carried."},"VoxSyndicate":{"value":"Vox Solaris"},"WinterFrost":{"value":"Thick Ice","desc":"Arctic Eximus globes have 30x their normal durability."},"Withering":{"value":"Untreatable","desc":"Pickups do not heal, and Health Orbs cannot be picked up."},"ZarimanSyndicate":{"value":"The Holdfasts"},"primevaulttrader":{"value":"Reines Aya"},"projectindex":{"value":"Index Punkte"}}
