uickly."},"CephalonSudaSyndicate":{"value":"Le Cephalon Suda"},"CetusSyndicate":{"value":"Ostron"},"ChemicalNoise":{"value":"Noise Suppression","desc":"Drones fly above Flare, spraying them with Efervon gas."},"CompetitionSpillover":{"value":"Competitive Streak","desc":"Random negative penalties from Amir and Aoi's \"Faceoff\" mode will be applied throughout the mission."},"ContactDamage":{"value":"Secondary Wounds","desc":"Gain 1 Puncture Status Effect every time you take damage."},"ContaminationZone":{"value":"Hold Your Breath","desc":"The entire region deals Toxin damage over time, increasing the longer players remain."},"DecayingFlesh":{"value":"Permanent Injury","desc":"Max health reduced each time health damage is taken"},"Deflectors":{"value":"Fortified Foes","desc":"Guardian Eximus units may be encountered, including Guardian Eximus Necramechs."},"DisruptiveSounds":{"value":"Vampire Rock","desc":"Flare creates a field that disrupts player abilities while draining energy to boost Flare's health. Flare slowly loses health when no players are in range."},"DoubleTrouble":{"value":"Double Trouble","desc":"Two Necramech Demolishers will attack any Conduit, but their health is reduced."},"DoubleTroubleLegacyte":{"value":"Mitosis","desc":"Two Legacytes spawn each round and twice as many captures are needed for success."},"DrainingResiduals":{"value":"Devil's Bargain","desc":"Allies within 4m of slain enemies gain 25% Fire Rate at the cost of -50% Ammo Efficiency."},"DullBlades":{"value":"Dull Blades","desc":"-50% melee combo chance"},"EMPBlackHole":{"value":"Alluring Arcocanids","desc":"As Rogue Arcocanids charge attacks, they pull Warframes towards them."},"EfervonFog":{"value":"Dense Fog","desc":"Efervon gas blankets the level. Enemies may drop filters that can provide a temporary reprieve."},"EnergyStarved":{"value":"Energy Exhaustion","desc":"Lose 2 Energy per second for each enemy within 10 meters of you."},"EntratiSyndicate":{"value":"Entrati"},"EscalateImmediately":{"value":"Cache Crash","desc":"Consequences of opening a Supply Cache are active from the start and will intensify if the Supply Cache is opened. Failure to open a Supply Cache doubles the kill count required to finish the mission."},"EventSyndicate":{"value":"Opérations syndicales"},"Exhaustion":{"value":"Energy Exhaustion","desc":"Lose 2 Energy per second for each enemy within 10 meters of you."},"EximusGrenadiers":{"value":"Eximus Amphors","desc":"Eximus units always drop Amphors."},"ExplosiveCrawlers":{"value":"Explosive Potential","desc":"Rupturing Fragments replace Shuffling Fragments."},"ExplosiveEnergy":{"value":"Miasmite Mash","desc":"Enemies drop Miasmites upon death that immediately rush Flare."},"FactionSwarm_Scaldra":{"value":"Scaldra Speed Run","desc":"All enemies are replaced with Scaldra and move much faster."},"FactionSwarm_Techrot":{"value":"Techrot Speed Run","desc":"All enemies are replaced with Techrot and move much faster."},"FallFog":{"value":"Foggy Fall","desc":"A fog limits vision across the mission zone."},"FortifiedFoes":{"value":"Sealed Armor","desc":"Enemies take 90% less damage from non-Weak Point hits."},"FragileNodes":{"value":"Unified Purpose","desc":"Enemies can target and destroy Conduits."},"Framecurse":{"value":"Framecurse syndrome","desc":"Activating an Ability inflicts 50 damage upon you."},"Gearless":{"value":"Gear Embargo","desc":"Gear cannot be used."},"GestatingTumors":{"value":"Sporogenesis","desc":"Techrot Tumors appear near Hell-Scrubbers, increasing the rate of life support decay with each active tumor."},"GrowingIncursion":{"value":"Fissure Cascade","desc":"Fissures rip into the mission, causing the Enemy Level to go up by 1 every 10s. Destroy them to stop the level from increasing further."},"HarshWords":{"value":"Barbed Glyphs","desc":"Each Glyph inflicts a small amount of damage when collected."},"HeavyWarfare":{"value":"Heavy Warfare","desc":"Enemies take 95% less damage from non-heavy weapons. Enemies will 