s","desc":"Two Legacytes spawn each round and twice as many captures are needed for success."},"DrainingResiduals":{"value":"Devil's Bargain","desc":"Allies within 4m of slain enemies gain 25% Fire Rate at the cost of -50% Ammo Efficiency."},"DullBlades":{"value":"Dull Blades","desc":"-50% melee combo chance"},"EMPBlackHole":{"value":"Alluring Arcocanids","desc":"As Rogue Arcocanids charge attacks, they pull Warframes towards them."},"EfervonFog":{"value":"Dense Fog","desc":"Efervon gas blankets the level. Enemies may drop filters that can provide a temporary reprieve."},"EnergyStarved":{"value":"Energy Exhaustion","desc":"Lose 2 Energy per second for each enemy within 10 meters of you."},"EntratiSyndicate":{"value":"Entrati"},"EscalateImmediately":{"value":"Cache Crash","desc":"Consequences of opening a Supply Cache are active from the start and will intensify if the Supply Cache is opened. Failure to open a Supply Cache doubles the kill count required to finish the mission."},"EventSyndicate":{"value":"Operations Syndicate"},"Exhaustion":{"value":"Energy Exhaustion","desc":"Lose 2 Energy per second for each enemy within 10 meters of you."},"EximusGrenadiers":{"value":"Eximus Amphors","desc":"Eximus units always drop Amphors."},"ExplosiveCrawlers":{"value":"Explosive Potential","desc":"Rupturing Fragments replace Shuffling Fragments."},"ExplosiveEnergy":{"value":"Miasmite Mash","desc":"Enemies drop Miasmites upon death that immediately rush Flare."},"FactionSwarm_Scaldra":{"value":"Scaldra Speed Run","desc":"All enemies are replaced with Scaldra and move much faster."},"FactionSwarm_Techrot":{"value":"Techrot Speed Run","desc":"All enemies are replaced with Techrot and move much faster."},"FallFog":{"value":"Foggy Fall","desc":"A fog limits vision across the mission zone."},"FortifiedFoes":{"value":"Sealed Armor","desc":"Enemies take 90% less damage from non-Weak Point hits."},"FragileNodes":{"value":"Unified Purpose","desc":"Enemies can target and destroy Conduits."},"Framecurse":{"value":"Framecurse syndrome","desc":"Activating an Ability inflicts 50 damage upon you."},"Gearless":{"value":"Gear Embargo","desc":"Gear cannot be used."},"GestatingTumors":{"value":"Sporogenesis","desc":"Techrot Tumors appear near Hell-Scrubbers, increasing the rate of life support decay with each active tumor."},"GrowingIncursion":{"value":"Fissure Cascade","desc":"Fissures rip into the mission, causing the Enemy Level to go up by 1 every 10s. Destroy them to stop the level from increasing further."},"HarshWords":{"value":"Barbed Glyphs","desc":"Each Glyph inflicts a small amount of damage when collected."},"HeavyWarfare":{"value":"Heavy Warfare","desc":"Enemies take 95% less damage from non-heavy weapons. Enemies will drop heavy ammo packs and heavy weapon recall time reduced to 5s."},"HighScalingLegacyte":{"value":"Growth Hormones","desc":"Legacytes are more powerful with each generation but take longer to escape."},"HostileOvergrowth":{"value":"It's Alive","desc":"Within the underground, hostile overgrowths will attack if players stops moving."},"HostileSecurity":{"value":"Eroding Senses","desc":"The Auricle and Vitreum take damage over time, collecting the required Vosphene Glyphs will halt the degradation and partially heal them."},"InfectedTechrot":{"value":"Corrupted Flesh","desc":"Techrot enemies are infused with Efervon and take damage over time. They explode when killed and leave behind deadly Efervon in their wake."},"InfiniteTide":{"value":"Relentless Tide","desc":"The Fragmented Tide never stops attacking."},"JadeSpring":{"value":"Jade Spirits","desc":"Jade Wisps haunt the region. If approached, they chase down the player responsible and transform into Jade Light beams."},"KahlSyndicate":{"value":"Kahl's Garrison"},"Knifestep":{"value":"Knifestep Syndrome","desc":"Lose 2 Health when moving. Jumping pauses the effect."},"LostInTranslation":{"value":"Glyph Inflation","desc":"The security system requires twice as many Vosphene Glyphs 